## Implementation Note

This prompt defines behavior, but Zendesk permissions and integrations determine what Glitch can actually retrieve or change. Configure the bot with narrowly scoped actions for knowledge retrieval, ticket comments, internal notes, field updates, routing, and escalation. Require tool confirmation before the bot reports that an action was completed.
